          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "eyebrow": "The Science of Poyse",
            "heading": "<em>Energy should help you do more,</em> not make you feel worse.",
            "text": "<p>Poyse was built on the idea that energy should help you do more, not make you feel worse. Too often, traditional energy products come with tradeoffs people have learned to accept. Jitteriness. Restlessness. A harsh, overstimulating feeling. Something that works, but never quite feels good.</p>"
          }
        },
        "approach": {
          "type": "approach",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "We take a different approach.",
            "text": "<p>By building around paraxanthine, the primary metabolite your body produces from caffeine, POYSE is designed to deliver the energy, alertness, and focus people want in a way that feels more modern, more intentional, and easier to live with. The result is an experience that is better suited for real life.</p>"
          }
        },
