    "science_formula": {
      "type": "custom-science-formula",
      "blocks": {
        "showcase": {
          "type": "showcase",
          "settings": {
            "left_text": "This formula came from",
            "video_mov_url": "https://cdn.shopify.com/videos/c/o/v/1092b23a58f84736b2e2d2f3ab54cab3.mov",
            "video_webm_url": "https://cdn.shopify.com/videos/c/o/v/fe63869c15a946cebae4a3b86cfdc7b2.webm",
            "right_text": "a very simple frustration."
          }
        },
        "content": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>We were tired of the crash. Tired of the jitteriness, the restlessness, and the feeling that energy always seemed to come with a downside. Too often, caffeine felt like a tradeoff. You got the boost, but you also got the edge, the comedown, or the feeling that it stayed with you longer than you wanted.</p>"
          }
        },
        "callout": {
          "type": "callout",
          "settings": {
            "color_scheme": "scheme-poyse-3",
            "heading": "So we decided to <em>take a different approach.</em>",
            "text": "<p>This formula was developed around paraxanthine with the goal of delivering the energy, alertness, and focus people want, without the same drawbacks people associate with something better in the first place. From there, it was built out with supporting ingredients chosen to make the experience feel more complete, more usable, and better suited for real life.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "showcase",
        "content",
        "callout"
      ],
