    "science_ingredients": {
      "type": "custom-science-ingredients",
      "blocks": {
        "ingredient_1": {
          "type": "ingredient",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Paraxanthine (Enfinity®)",
            "badge": "150mg Per Serving",
            "text": "<p>Paraxanthine is the primary metabolite your body produces from caffeine and is responsible for many of the benefits people associate with it, including energy, alertness, focus, and mental stamina. When caffeine is consumed, the body breaks it down into several metabolites, with paraxanthine being the most abundant.</p><p>By isolating Paraxanthine, we are able to deliver many of caffeine's positive effects without the same drawbacks people often associate with traditional caffeine, like jitteriness, restlessness, and an overly harsh feel. Because paraxanthine has a shorter half-life than caffeine, it clears the body faster and does not stick around the same way. That makes it well suited for later-day use without disrupting sleep the way caffeine often can.</p>"
          }
        },
        "ingredient_2": {
          "type": "ingredient",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Amino Acids",
            "badge": "Three Compounds, One System",
            "text": "<p>These amino acids were included to support more than just energy alone. Each one plays a different role in helping shape how the product feels and performs. <em>Together, these amino acids help create a more complete experience by supporting focus, feel, and performance alongside paraxanthine.</em></p>"
          }
        },
        "sub_item_1": {
          "type": "sub_item",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "L-Tyrosine",
            "badge": "500mg",
            "text": "<p>L-Tyrosine is an amino acid involved in the production of key brain chemicals related to focus, alertness, and mental performance. It was included to help support staying sharp, clear-headed, and mentally engaged when a lot is being demanded of you.</p>"
          }
        },
        "sub_item_2": {
          "type": "sub_item",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "L-Theanine",
            "badge": "200mg",
            "text": "<p>L-Theanine is an amino acid naturally found in tea leaves and is known for helping promote a calmer, more composed feel. In this product, it helps round out the experience so the energy feels less harsh and more controlled.</p>"
          }
        },
        "sub_item_3": {
          "type": "sub_item",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "L-Citrulline",
            "badge": "2000mg",
            "text": "<p>L-Citrulline is an amino acid commonly used in performance products because it helps support nitric oxide production and blood flow. It was included to make the product more functional for real life, movement, training, and sustained physical output.</p>"
          }
        },
        "ingredient_3": {
          "type": "ingredient",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Electrolytes",
            "badge": "Balanced Electrolyte Complex",
            "text": "<p>Electrolytes were included to make the product more functional for real life. Energy is only one part of the equation. When you are training, moving through long days, or simply trying to perform at a high level, hydration and fluid balance matter too.</p><p>Sodium, potassium, and magnesium are essential minerals that help regulate fluid balance, muscle function, and overall performance. Including them helps support a more complete experience, especially for people using the product before workouts, during busy days, or in situations where they want more than just stimulation alone.</p><p>Rather than treating electrolytes as an afterthought, they were included to better support the kind of daily output this product is actually meant for.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
